  "description": "WopiHost.RedisLockProvider Class Library — distributed lock provider backed by Redis, with atomic compare-and-swap via server-side conditional commands (SET IFEQ/DELIFEQ, requires Redis 8.4+) and TTL-driven WOPI expiry. Best-effort against a single Redis instance; deliberately does not implement Redlock — see the README for the rationale.",
